  "design": {
    "entrance": "Extreme macro crop on the bevel of the first letter with shallow depth of field and a raking edge light; the camera dollies backward on a long eased move while the tilt flattens out.",
    "reveal": "The pull-back lands exactly on the impact frame with a tiny settle; focus snaps crisp and the edge light flares.",
    "camera": "Backward dolly from 6.5x with perspective tilt/yaw unwinding to frontal; macro DOF opening to full focus.",
    "material": "Deep crimson gloss lacquer with fine grain, warm bevel highlights and a travelling specular glint.",
    "exit": "Rack focus: the title defocuses into soft bokeh and the light fades."
  },
  "fusion_notes": [
    "Fusion zooms the vector Text+ itself (Size/Center driven by expressions) so the close-up stays crisp; use 'Text Scale' to resize the final title. The preview also tilts/yaws the camera for perspective, which the 2D Fusion graph approximates with a slight rotation."
  ],
